lls/120620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120620","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120620.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120620.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-15T17:00:28Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120606\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nScene Paint Mode snap now considers the Grid Offset for its painting snap.\r\nPlus this also fixes the 'allow overlapping' paint detection for painting inside scaled nodes.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40a948b6-27fb-4b75-b4ed-b5713f927bfa\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nPlease note that holding `shift` toggles the 'allow overlapping' options.\r\nSo if the no overlap does not seem to be working, be aware that sticky shift is still an issue here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90320 \r\n(Had it happen here once while testing)\r\n\r\nFor now, pressing shift once anywhere inside Godot can un-stick it.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/i